# The pinned runtime, resolved from the committed lockfile.
node_modules/

# NOTHING ELSE IS IGNORED HERE, deliberately. `run/` and `work/` used to
# be, back when the disposable authority, Job records and attempt state
# sat beside the code in an external root. They now live under the
# external `state_root` in `poc.json`, and a proof run asserts that this
# subtree holds none of it. Ignoring those names again would hide
# exactly the regression that assertion exists to catch.
